{
  "_comment": "Template \u2014 copy to trustpin.json and fill with real values from https://app.trustpin.cloud. Consumed by TrustPin.shared.setupWithNativeBundle() on Android; parsed by the native Kotlin SDK via TrustPinConfiguration.fromAssets(context, 'trustpin.json'). Required: organization_id, project_id, public_key. Optional: mode ('strict' | 'permissive'), configuration_url (HTTPS). App attestation (TrustPinAttest.shared.setupWithNativeBundle()): attest_verifier_url (your verifier's https URL), attested_hosts (the hosts that receive the TrustPin-Attestation header) and, when the policy uses Play Integrity, google_cloud_project_number.",
  "organization_id": "YOUR_ORGANIZATION_ID",
  "project_id": "YOUR_PROJECT_ID",
  "public_key": "YOUR_PUBLIC_KEY",
  "mode": "strict",
  "attest_verifier_url": "https://attest.example.com",
  "attested_hosts": [
    "api.example.com"
  ]
}
